+### Add Multiple Commands (CLI)
+
+You can add multiple commands at once using the `add` subcommand directly from the command line.
+
+-   **From a comma-separated string:**
+
+    ```bash
+    cli-stash add --bulk "command1,command2,command with spaces"
+    ```
+
+-   **From a file (one command per line):**
+
+    ```bash
+    cli-stash add --file /path/to/commands.txt
+    ```
